OL,3,GNEWSAWomen voice frustration over      
OL,4,Asafety as hundreds join night march    
OL,6,FCampaigners say frustration is growing 
OL,7,Fat the lack of progress on violence    
OL,8,Fagainst women and girls despite        
OL,9,Fgenerations of activism.               
OL,11,FHundreds joined a Reclaim the Night    
OL,12,Fmarch in Worcester, which organisers   
OL,13,Fsaid attracted its largest crowd since 
OL,14,F2018.                                  
OL,16,FThe movement campaigns to end violence 
OL,17,Fagainst women and girls and promote    
OL,18,Fwomen's right to feel safe in public   
OL,19,Fspaces at night.                       
